{
  "id": "Lyo.Compression.Xz",
  "name": "Lyo.Compression.Xz",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "XZ / LZMA2 compression addon for `Lyo.Compression`. Registers an XZ `ICompressorFactory`.",
  "description": "XZ / LZMA2 compression addon for `Lyo.Compression`. Registers an XZ `ICompressorFactory`.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register with DI",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "using Lyo.Compression;\nusing Lyo.Compression.Models;\nusing Lyo.Compression.Xz;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;\nusing Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;\n\nservices.AddXzCompressor();\nservices.AddCompressionService(options => options.DefaultAlgorithm = XzCompressionAlgorithm.Instance);\nservices.AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>();\n\n// Or from IConfiguration\nservices.AddXzCompressor();\nservices.AddCompressionServiceFromConfiguration(configuration, CompressionServiceOptions.SectionName);\nservices.AddDefaultCompressionService<CompressionService>();"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Dependency injection",
      "text": "See [`Lyo.Compression`](../Lyo.Compression/README.md) for the registration overview, `ICompressionResolver`, and configuration file example. **File storage reads:** register `AddXzCompressor()` when stored metadata may reference XZ; reads dispatch through `ICompressionResolver` by `CompressionAlgorithm` metadata."
    }
  ],
